 V("bs-exact","Exact match","Sorted array, find x or say it is absent.","while (lo <= hi) {\n  mid = lo + (hi - lo) / 2;\n  if (a[mid] == x) return mid;\n  if (a[mid] < x) lo = mid + 1; else hi = mid - 1;\n}",[["LC","704","Binary search"]],["Lower and upper bound"]),
